# Activity opens deep in the list while the rows above are still estimates,
# then pulls to refresh and prepends at the top and in the middle.
route Activity
latency 400,900
wait 2.5
mark pull-at-top
pan 200 250 0 450 700
wait 4
mark pull-again
pan 200 250 0 450 700
wait 4
mark prepend-top
press 210 78
wait 2.5
mark scroll-mid
repeat 3 pan 200 700 0 -450 300
wait 1.5
mark prepend-mid
press 210 78
wait 2.5
